      "decision": "Pilot with 450 steps/lr 5e-3 left several seeds with a collapsed triangle/square class even on clean labels, so noise effects would be confounded by convergence luck. Switched to 600 steps and lr 1e-2 (lr 1e-2 gave higher clean mIoU in two pilot seeds); grid reduced to 4 seeds in main and fewer sweeps to fit the CPU budget."
